%% Sequence — student join request accepted by CR
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor St as Student
  participant UI as Web app
  participant API as API server
  participant DB as Database
  actor CR as CR / DCR
  participant Mail as Email service

  St->>UI: Fill join form (UV ID, section, group)
  UI->>API: POST /join-requests
  API->>DB: Section has CR? UV ID unused? rejections < 5 / 24 h?
  DB-->>API: OK
  API->>DB: Insert join_request (pending)
  API->>DB: Audit log: claim submitted
  API-->>UI: 201 pending
  UI-->>St: "Waiting for approval"
  API-)CR: Dashboard notification (pending request)
  CR->>UI: Open request (name, email, photo, UV ID, group)
  UI->>API: POST /join-requests/{id}/accept {group: G2}
  API->>DB: findOneAndUpdate where status = pending (transaction)
  alt Already decided by another CR/DCR
    API-->>UI: 409 "Already handled"
  else First action wins
    API->>DB: status = accepted, create enrolment (semester stamp)
    API->>DB: Add student to section group conversation
    API->>DB: Audit log: accepted by CR
    API-)Mail: "Join request accepted"
    Mail--)St: Email
    API-->>UI: 200
  end
  St->>UI: Reload dashboard
  UI->>API: GET /me/routine
  API-->>UI: Section + G2 slots
  UI-->>St: My routine + live status
